── Section 2: Arithmetic Intensity ──

  Arithmetic intensity (AI) = FLOPs performed / bytes of memory traffic.
  Unit: FLOPs/byte.

  High AI → compute-bound (large GEMMs, convolutions with big batch sizes).
  Low AI  → memory-bandwidth-bound (elementwise ops, small-batch inference).

  GPT-2 QKV projection (768→768, FP16):
    batch=1   : 1.00 FLOPs/byte  memory-bound
    batch=32  : 30.72 FLOPs/byte  memory-bound
    batch=512 : 307.20 FLOPs/byte  COMPUTE-BOUND
  ReLU (1M elements, FP32):
    AI        : 0.12 FLOPs/byte  memory-bound
  ✓ Section 2 passed

